{"id":"n46944-1-18","stage":1,"title":"감사 · 感谢","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n46944-1-18-1","ko":"웬 선물이에요?","zh":"这是什么礼物啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"웬","meaning":"有个","explanation":"웬：有个","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"2","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물이에요?","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"有个","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"某个。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/e977f91ade8dad3d1ce3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n46944-1-18-2","ko":"그동안 제게 잘해 주신 것에 대한 감사의 뜻으로 드리는 거예요.","zh":"这是为了感谢您一直以来对我的关照而送的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제게","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘해","meaning":"善待","explanation":"잘하다：善待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주신","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것에","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감사의","meaning":"感谢","explanation":"감사：感谢；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"감사","audio":"/audio/3f663e28cb8bea91b2ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46944","senseId":"1","lemma":"감사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜻으로","meaning":"意，意思","explanation":"뜻：意，意思；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뜻","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43785","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜻","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드리는","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善待","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"亲切、用心地对待。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"3f663e28cb8bea91","term":"감사","zh":"感谢","audio":"/audio/3f663e28cb8bea91b2ae.mp3","entryId":"46944","definition":"心存感激；或指那种心情。","pronunciation":["감ː사"]},{"id":"883d841ce6a33cf7","term":"뜻","zh":"意，意思","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3","entryId":"43785","definition":"语言、文字或行为所表达的内容。","pronunciation":["뜯"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f1c66796720619b6a14.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.785,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=46944","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.6117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是为了感谢您一直以来对我的关照而送的。","这是什么礼物啊？","一个盒子里有几个苹果呀？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是什么礼物啊？","一个盒子里有几个苹果呀？","这是为了感谢您一直以来对我的关照而送的。"],"answer":2}]}
